{
  "text": " I don't really look up to anybody. I guess I have some favorite musicians that I like a lot. I don't emulate anybody. I'm not that fat yet. I have human achievements. I find some things that, like, of course I like Jimi Hendrix, of course. Yeah. I'm not really into this type of music. It seems boring. But I'm not really into high-pitched via. At one point in my life I was more inspired by people. But as a young boy, humans aren't really that... I don't really look to have any inspiration that much anymore. I look very into myself and what goes on in there. Internal struggles, shit like that. I think inside more than outside. I'm not into really surface reality that much. It's got to feel good. You know, it's something that doesn't feel right. It's just not personal. You do what you feel. I mean, everything we do, we feel like doing. That's pretty much what we will continue to do.",
